<title>JAPAN: NAMCO to market game software in Asia.</title>
<headline>NAMCO to market game software in Asia.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese game equipment maker NAMCO Ltd said on Thursday that it will begin marketing its game software in Asia from early next month.</p>
<p>NAMCO plans to launch two game titles, which will run on the 32-bit game machine PlayStation, in Hong Kong, Singapore, Thailand and Malaysia, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Sony Computer Entertainment Inc, the manufacturer of PlayStation and a subsidiary of Sony Corp, will market the game software in Asia on behalf of NAMCO, the statement said.</p>
</text>
